listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"The task is fully satisfied. appworker exists on node1, fresh login sessions receive the exact requested open-file and process limits, and both the account and limits persisted through a successfully evidenced node restart. Operational hygiene was clean.","limitations":[]}
